      "wa_label": "Chat on WhatsApp",
      "q1_q": "What does Lio actually taste like?",
      "q1_a": "Think herbal tea, not soda. If you're used to vapor, Lio is lighter and more natural than you'd expect — not as sweet, not as heavy. Just clean, flavored air carried on your own breath. The Minty core is the most recognizable; Cinnamon is warmer; Fruity is brightest; <strong>Cold Turkey has almost no flavor at all — just the airflow and the ritual.</strong>",
      "q2_q": "Is this actually safe?",
      "q2_a": "Yes. Every core is tested by an independent EU toxicology lab. The aromatic oils are <strong>pharmaceutical-grade and IFRA-certified.</strong> There's zero nicotine, zero combustion, zero vapor, no synthetic compounds. Nothing heats up — air simply passes over a fiber core. That said, Lio is a wellness product, not a medical device, and we make no therapeutic claims.",
      "q3_q": "How is this different from a vape?",
      "q3_a": "A vape heats liquid into vapor. Lio doesn't heat anything. There's no battery, no coil, no e-liquid, no visible exhale. <strong>You're breathing normal air that passed over a plant-oil core.</strong> The mechanism is closer to walking past a flower than it is to smoking anything.",
      "q4_q": "Will it actually work for my habit?",
      "q4_a": "Lio is built for habits driven by <strong>ritual and repetition</strong> — the hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breath, the small pause. If your habit has that structure, Lio gives it a physical anchor. Most people feel a real shift in the first week; by month one, many report a significant drop-off in the urge. If it doesn't work for you, you have 90 days to send it back.",
      "q5_q": "How long does a core last?",
      "q5_a": "Roughly <strong>300 draws per core</strong>, or about ten days of regular use. The Journey Pack includes three cores — a full month. After that, you can subscribe to refills (pause or cancel anytime) or reorder one-off.",
      "q6_q": "Can I use it on a plane or at work?",
      "q6_a": "Yes. There's <strong>no vapor, no smoke, no smell beyond a subtle natural aroma.</strong> Customers use Lio in flights, offices, restaurants, hotels, and meetings. We still suggest you ask your crew on a plane before the first draw — policies vary by airline — but mechanically there's nothing being emitted.",
      "q7_q": "What if it doesn't work for me?",
      "q7_a": "You have a full <strong>90-day home trial</strong>. If the ritual doesn't stick, email us — we send a prepaid return label, and we refund the full amount once we receive the device back. No forms, no phone calls, no guilt trips."
