      "p_started_1": "Lio began in Amsterdam in 2018, in a small workshop on the Prinsengracht. Two of us — brothers — were watching the people closest to us try, and fail, to quit. <strong>The patches addressed half the habit. The chewing gum, less. The vapes, none of the right half.</strong>",
